cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "ale-cooccurrence-figures: figure code for the ALE co-occurrence and mutual exclusivity article"
authors:
  - given-names: Binhuan
    family-names: Sun
  - given-names: Adam M.
    family-names: Feist
  - given-names: Patrick V.
    family-names: Phaneuf
  - given-names: Alberto
    family-names: Santos
repository-code: "https://github.com/Multiomics-Analytics-Group/ale-cooccurrence-figures"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  The code that draws the figures of the article "A statistical framework for
  identifying candidate genetic interactions from adaptive laboratory evolution
  data" from the outputs of the analysis pipeline
  ale-cooccurrence-mutual-exclusivity-nf. It comes with two conda environments
  and the data it reads, so the figures can be rebuilt without running the
  pipeline.
keywords:
  - adaptive laboratory evolution
  - ALEdb
  - co-occurrence
  - mutual exclusivity
